{"about_the_game":"In Death Scourges: Prologue, you're embody the captain of a special strike team which crash-landed in the ominous Blackwoods. Fight your way through unnameable horrors, scavenge the remains of a once thriving research site and unveil the secrets that lay deep within a giant laboratory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRASH LANDING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.webm?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.mp4?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your helicopter got shot down and you crashed into the Blackwoods before you got your full mission briefing... The deeper you advance into the forest the more you realise that this isn't a job like any other...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THIRD PERSON COMBAT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.webm?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/d64a5160fdf15758e9596989d0d7edfe.mp4?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Target your enemies with the classic over-the-shoulder perspective and perform powerful combat attack on stunned enemies!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE TEAM IS YOUR WEAPON</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.webm?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c60a05fe251894293a3c6067af75a08b.mp4?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your teammates Patcher, Nitro and Redlight obey your orders. The more efficient you place them, the more likely your odds of survival...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WEAPON ARSENAL</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.webm?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/0fb1e937a5921ed12ecd0ef8650ee459.mp4?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Manufacture powerful firearms that aid you mowing down the horros that lie hidden beneath. Find blueprints for pistols, mps, shotguns, rifles and more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESSOURCE MANAGEMENT</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.webm?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/c1a8ee7b15309cf30865bbcd00d94c7d.mp4?t=1758048559\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Manage your ressources and combine components to craft improvised combat ultility items such as medical stims and handgrenades!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846020?t=1758048559","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2846020?t=1758048559","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/b754bfe2f93b15d3a31fee9b816898fa5d540ff1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758048559","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/b754bfe2f93b15d3a31fee9b816898fa5d540ff1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758048559","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"A lot of blood. Limbs can be shot off. But it's all in a low-poly style."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In Death Scourges: Prologue, you're embody the captain of a special strike team which crash-landed in the ominous Blackwoods. Fight your way through unnameable horrors, scavenge the remains of a once thriving research site and unveil the secrets that lay deep within a giant laboratory.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRASH LANDING</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf7166815e.poster.avif?t=1758048559\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846020/extras/601cbd2022f90e86139303cf